<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0652_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you. The\nconnection trash.\rCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? What’s good?\nI’m doin’ GREAT!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ain’t there other Hustlers you’d\nrather scrap than me?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My free time?\nI’m usually free Friday mornings.\fTry callin’ me then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you!\rScrap me again!\nWhat you say? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\nDon’t be late, soldier!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nYou must be pretty busy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nWell, I appreciate you wanna\fscrap me again, but didn’t you promise\fsomebody else?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fDon’t forget! C’mon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! This Lt. Surge.\nHow you livin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you forget I’m standin’\nin the Saffron Dojo\fwaitin’ on you?\rGuess I got here first.\nI’ll be waitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, why you think I put all them\ntraps in the Vermilion Block?\rThat’s right!\nTo test the brains of any\fHustler who come in to scrap!\rScraps ain’t just about\npower or stamina.\rIf you balance power and\nbrains, then you got the\fmakings of a great Hustler!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I was fightin’ for my country,\nI raised a lotta Hustlers, showed\f’em the ropes.\rBut!\rBy the time you met me, you already\nhad your skills on lock!\rWhere you train? Who taught you how\nto scrap?\rIt’s so weird and amazin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0652_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been studyin’ how people talk\naround here since I became Block Boss\fin Vermilion.\rBut there’s still so much slang\nI don’t understand.\rAyo, will you talk with me some more?\nWe could teach each other some\fnew things to say! No cap!</language>
	</row>
</body>
